{"overview":"ماسانه آمها و دخترش ریهوکو از سازمان دولتی رفاه کودک که می‌خواهد ریهوکو را از مادرش بگیرد، فرار می‌کنند. آن‌ها دستگیر می‌شوند و ریهوکو گرفته می‌شود. در همین حین، ماسانه توسط سلاح پیشرفته‌ای که می‌تواند خود را به شکل انسان مخفی کند، مورد حمله قرار می‌گیرد. در مواجهه با خطر، نوری عجیب از مچ دست او ساطع می‌شود و او به موجودی قدرتمند تبدیل می‌شود. او در کشمکش قدرت بین سازمان‌های قدرتمند دخیل می‌شود و به دلیل داشتن قدرتمندترین سلاح—«ویچ‌بلید» افسانه‌ای—در مرکز توجه آن‌ها قرار می‌گیرد.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Masane Amaha and her daughter Rihoko are on the run from a government child welfare agency that wants to take Rihoko away from her mother. They are caught and Rihoko is taken away. Meanwhile, Masane is attacked by an advanced weapon that can disguise itself as a human being. When faced with the danger, a strange light emits from her wrist and she transforms into a powerful being. She becomes involved in a power struggle between powerful organizations, with her at the center of their attention because she holds the greatest power of them all, the legendary Witchblade.","tagline_en":"And she must discover the answers for herself. As she stands on the brink of destiny, she is forced to seek the balance between ecstasy and ruin.","runtime":24,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":24,"y":2006,"poster":"/rURfkcQ0OjiboUyzf8OnEruBouE.jpg"}],"episodes":24,"crew":["大橋誉志光"],"crew_en":["Yoshimitsu Ohashi"],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"能登麻美子","role":"Masane Amaha (voice)","photo":"/wCSD7Umgzc66p8VGXrrMZtSLSuS.jpg","en":"Mamiko Noto"},{"name":"神田朱未","role":"Rihoko Amaha (voice)","photo":"/plEZZj1gMzFXKeq6jtljSygs7wi.jpg","en":"Akemi Kanda"},{"name":"松風雅也","role":"Yusuke Tozawa (voice)","photo":"/tUd3ybETFz4hBGLnaqt3VreGeDJ.jpg","en":"Masaya Matsukaze"},{"name":"میئه سونوزاکی","role":"Reina Soho (voice)","photo":"/iYnpn1e7Ba1oMK8ZdgAvqzxng9e.jpg","en":"Mie Sonozaki"},{"name":"伊藤静","role":"Shiori Tsuzuki (voice)","photo":"/n47YvFPlJzl8HnsoDB